### /config/appName
GET http://localhost:48791/config/appName

### /config/isTest
GET http://localhost:48791/config/isTest

### /config/sysName
GET http://localhost:48791/config/sysName

### /config/orderName
GET http://localhost:48791/config/orderName

### /config/orderDetail
GET http://localhost:48791/config/orderDetail

### /config/appInfo
GET http://localhost:48791/config/appInfo

### /config/openAIApiKey
GET http://localhost:48791/config/openAIApiKey

### /config/getProperty?key=SPD_AI_ENABLE
# 返回 true：直接读取系统环境变量 SPD_AI_ENABLE
GET http://localhost:48791/config/getProperty?key=SPD_AI_ENABLE

### /config/getProperty?key=AI_ENABLED
# 返回 false：直接读取系统环境变量 AI_ENABLED
GET http://localhost:48791/config/getProperty?key=AI_ENABLED

### /config/getProperty?key=ai.enabled
# 返回 false：OS 环境变量优先级高于 application.yaml，SystemEnvironmentPropertySource 将 ai.enabled
# 宽松匹配到 AI_ENABLED=false 并直接返回，导致 application.yaml 中的 ${SPD_AI_ENABLE:true} 被短路覆盖
GET http://localhost:48791/config/getProperty?key=ai.enabled

